From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:47:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: Answer other interfaces of the SAX reader with a
 WARN.

Windows 11's reader has none of them either, IMarshal and the two
Office asks for among them (tools/startupgapsprobe misc).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/msxml3/saxreader.c b/dlls/msxml3/saxreader.c
index 6afc1e1b854..4ffc386d91c 100644
--- a/dlls/msxml3/saxreader.c
+++ b/dlls/msxml3/saxreader.c
@@ -6695,7 +6695,8 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI saxxmlreader_QueryInterface(IVBSAXXMLReader *iface, REFIID
     }
     else
     {
-        FIXME("interface %s not implemented\n", debugstr_guid(riid));
+        /* Windows 11's reader has no others either, IMarshal among them */
+        WARN("interface %s not implemented\n", debugstr_guid(riid));
         return E_NOINTERFACE;
     }
 
